    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "370501FDAA453FEC",
      "text": "欢迎来到霜抹山道馆！\\n需要再听一次\\r\\n道馆测验的说明吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "370504FDAA454505",
      "text": "霜抹山道馆的道馆测验是……\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]雪山速滑[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "370503FDAA454352",
      "text": "请骑着坐骑宝可梦在指定赛道上滑行，\\n并在限制时间内到达终点！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "3704FEFDAA453AD3",
      "text": "详细规则请你先出本道馆，\\n爬上左手边的坡道，\\r\\n到那前面的雪山速滑起点处后再做说明吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
