    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "64B056279C27961C",
      "text": "嗨，我一直在等你。\\n这里就是雪山速滑的起点处。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "64B059279C279B35",
      "text": "我要请你骑着坐骑宝可梦\\n在大自然赛道上滑行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "64B058279C279982",
      "text": "只要在目标时间内到达终点，\\n就能通过道馆测验！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "64B053279C279103",
      "text": "要立刻挑战雪山速滑\\n这个道馆测验吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "64B052279C278F50",
      "text": "好好去享受白银的世界吧！\\n那么，开始！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "66DD846D70418449",
      "text": "我要挑战",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "66DD816D70417F30",
      "text": "我要听说明",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_select_03",
      "hash64": "66DD826D704180E3",
      "text": "算了",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "64B055279C279469",
      "text": "恭喜你到达终点！\\n你滑得让人无可挑剔！\\r\\n简直就像当时活跃在第一线的古鲁夏……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "5BAE1046691347DE",
      "text": "哦！道馆测验大获成功！\\n去前台报告结果吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "64B054279C2792B6",
      "text": "很遗憾，雪山速滑的测验失败了！\\n不过，很庆幸你没受伤！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "64B05F279C27A567",
      "text": "道馆测验的挑战\\n不限次数，放心好了！\\r\\n别放弃，也别勉强，再加把劲吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_koori_020_ui_01",
      "hash64": "C4ACC717DB60A68F",
      "text": "放弃",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
